<title>BELGIUM: Artemis narrows 1995/96 loss to $1.56 mln.</title>
<headline>Artemis narrows 1995/96 loss to $1.56 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>    Group net loss		    1.56   vs   5.24</p>
<p>    Dividend			    none   vs   none</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  0.34   vs   0.65 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Art auctioneers Artemis, with units in Britain, New York, Germany and Switzerland, is controlled by Cie Nationale a Portefeuille /Nationalsportefeuille maatschapij.</p>
<p>In a statement in Belgian newspapers the company said the loss was due to a $1.69 million provision on its London property.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
